&lt;p data-start=&quot;1710&quot; data-end=&quot;1729&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1710&quot; data-end=&quot;1729&quot;&gt;WHY Autoscout24&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1731&quot; data-end=&quot;2081&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of growth. &lt;/strong&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2200&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
